      "content": "therapy doesnt fix the exhaustion. it's just more talking. i look at my life and i just see this endless cycle of pain and watching people i love suffer. sometimes i just sit here and think... what if i could just sleep and not have to worry about any of it anymore? like, just a permanent quiet. it feels like the only thing that actually makes sense.",
